  message: "Shipped in PR #3719. Fix: when OLD endpoint violates _TAG_NAME_RE, treat as forward migration — drop any pre-existing legacy catalog entry, skip audit-trail bump on legacy half. Snake_case→snake_case renames still record both endpoints. Two new tests + six regressions pass; 100% coverage. The 21-item BVT-discipline migration that surfaced this would now succeed in a single clean rename."  # 9f85
